  "policy": "Best-effort wrapping/reserved legend space keeps the exact figure. Only apply a positive working rectangle; after final draw inspect automatic panel titles/suptitle/named outside legends for canvas bounds or mutual overlap with1pixel tolerance. Warn generically without echoing input text; manual title/legend positions remain caller-owned. No automatic font shrink/newlines/canvas resize.",
  "tests": "Seven bounds/manual/fit fixtures plus fresh CLI warning/exactPNGcanvas and warning-as-error rollback/lifecycle cases. Explicit tiny/oversized fixtures retain old Matplotlib warnings as well.",
  "limits": "LAY06supported detectionpolicy passed;LAY04remainsRUNNINGforCJK/otherfont/group combinations. This is a measured bbox diagnostic, not universal aesthetic/legibility guarantee or arbitrary artist collision detection. Existing auto-layout-off/manual positions are not newly managed.",
